{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39866","headline":"再幸华清宫 · 徐夤","name":"再幸华清宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肠断将军改葬归，锦囊香在忆当时。\n年来却恨相思树，春至不生连理枝。\n雪女塚头瑶草合，贵妃池里玉莲衰。\n霓裳旧曲飞霜殿，梦破魂惊绝後期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}